WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Empryo. Knows your code by heart.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.900
Desktop app. It maps your repo first.
Files, symbols and imports, ranked. 171 files import loader.ts.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.400
Terminal app. It knows what an edit will touch.
186 files depend on tokens.ts, and themes.md usually changes with it.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.300
Terminal app. It searches the map, then reads.
One Genome search, 2 hits, then 24 lines of loader.ts instead of the whole file.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.600
Desktop app. Every edit lands as a diff.
Then it runs the tests for the code it just changed.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:31.500
Terminal app. Same agent in your terminal.
The diff, plus the test file that usually changes with loader.ts.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Knows your code by heart.
Edits TypeScript and JavaScript by symbol, through the syntax tree.
Asks language servers for definitions, references and callers.
Remembers decisions and gotchas, per project.
Desktop app, terminal, or headless in scripts and CI.
Install: curl -fsSL https://empryo.com/install.sh | bash
Docs: empryo.com/docs
